From 449c2aced0161dfb498145ae51a4105c67e96039 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Gonzalez <dev@gonzalezerik.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:10:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] tester: Add ibookg3-qemu

Allow a BSP configuration to name the QEMU command with bsp_qemu_cmd.
The QEMU system emulator for 32-bit PowerPC is qemu-system-ppc, which
does not follow the qemu-system-%{bsp_arch} pattern.

Add the configuration for the ibookg3 BSP on QEMU's mac99 machine. Its
console is the first serial port.
---
 tester/rtems/testing/bsps/ibookg3-qemu.ini | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 tester/rtems/testing/qemu.cfg              |  6 ++-
 2 files changed, 48 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 tester/rtems/testing/bsps/ibookg3-qemu.ini

diff --git a/tester/rtems/testing/bsps/ibookg3-qemu.ini b/tester/rtems/testing/bsps/ibookg3-qemu.ini
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..47533ba
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tester/rtems/testing/bsps/ibookg3-qemu.ini
@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@
